# 35. EXAM TRAPS

> **Attack simulation means performing a real attack.**

False.

> **The objective is to compromise as many systems as possible.**

False.

> **A missed detection automatically means the entire security system failed.**

False.

The specific telemetry, rule, and monitoring path should be investigated.

> **Red Team and Blue Team should never cooperate.**

False.

Purple Team activities encourage collaboration and improvement.

